```css
:root {
  --color-text: #1f2937;
  --color-bg: #ffffff;
  --space-2: 0.5rem;
  --space-4: 1rem;
  --font-body: system-ui, sans-serif;
}
.theme-dark {
  --color-text: #f3f4f6;
  --color-bg: #111827;
}
.card {
  color: var(--color-text);
  background: var(--color-bg);
  padding: var(--space-4);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
}
```

| Where the card sits | --color-text it gets |
|---|---|
| anywhere. | #1f2937 (from :root). |
| inside `.theme-dark`. | #f3f4f6 (nearest ancestor). |

